  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "During the contest over a supreme true inheritance light, silver-white light comes from refinement by Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s Gu Immortal will, while Fang Yuan and Mo Yao contribute other colors of will light.",
      "chapters": [
        624
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_mo_yao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mo Yao later says she would have struck Spring Autumn Cicada long ago if it held only a mortal’s consciousness, but Fang Yuan’s Gu Immortal will is still inside, so she only influences him in secret.",
      "chapters": [
        645
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan tries to trigger Gu Immortal wills suppressed in Dong Fang Chang Fan’s body to force that immortal into a mistake.",
      "chapters": [
        802
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battle-of-wills",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Eight Gu Immortal wills defend Dong Fang Yu Liang’s will like thick shields.",
      "chapters": [
        805
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wills-as-shields",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_yu_liang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In treasure yellow heaven, some traders are Gu Immortal wills and others are divine senses of Gu Immortals in the middle of a deal.",
      "chapters": [
        1399
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trade-proxies",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Immortal wills are usually unable to make the decision; they can only follow commands left by the Gu Immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        1569
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
